# Raster Habitat Cuts are MCP / Blend-ci output, not Git LFS objects.
# They are large, GPU-dependent, and not bit-stable across Blender versions.
# Rebuild later with Blend-ci; until then they stay gitignored.
# The committed stand-in is screenshots/<epoch>/preview.svg
# (`time-slice preview --seed N --out screenshots`).
screenshots/**/*.png binary
screenshots/**/*.jpg binary
screenshots/**/*.webp binary
screenshots/**/*.svg text eol=lf
playbooks/*.json text eol=lf
